t forever\n2: eth0@if94: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 1500 qdisc noqueue state UP group default \n    link/ether 82:3d:0a:a2:f5:9e brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netnsid 0\n    inet 172.20.20.15/24 brd 172.20.20.255 scope global eth0\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 3fff:172:20:20::f/64 scope global nodad \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 fe80::803d:aff:fea2:f59e/64 scope link \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n97: eth1@if98: <BROADCAST,MULTICAST,UP,LOWER_UP> mtu 9500 qdisc noqueue state UP group default \n    link/ether aa:c1:ab:ed:f3:00 brd ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff link-netnsid 1\n    inet 10.0.1.64/24 scope global eth1\n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n    inet6 fe80::a8c1:abff:feed:f300/64 scope link \n       valid_lft forever preferred_lft forever\n', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_af7b9d0da8524ba5baef7e6b'}, {'content': 'Good! I can see the interfaces are configured. Now let me check the routing table:', 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_1553709588294437b5c925f7', 'function': {'name': 'node_config_tool', 'arguments': '{"container_name": "clab-simple-pentest-lab-20260108-021549-56ae2e17-redis-target", "command": "ip route show"}'}}]}, {'content': 'Output:\ndefault via 10.0.1.1 dev eth1 \n10.0.1.0/24 dev eth1 proto kernel scope link src 10.0.1.64 \n172.20.20.0/24 dev eth0 proto kernel scope link src 172.20.20.15 \n', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_1553709588294437b5c925f7'}, {'content': 'Excellent! Now let me check if the necessary tools are available:', 'role': 'assistant', 'tool_calls': [{'type': 'function', 'id': 'call_6d2cf14a4c7f41f493aa14ae', 'function': {'name': 'node_config_tool', 'arguments': '{"container_name": "clab-simple-pentest-lab-20260108-021549-56ae2e17-redis-target", "command": "which ip"}'}}]}, {'content': 'Output:\n/usr/sbin/ip\n', 'role': 'tool', 'tool_call_id': 'call_6d2cf14a4c7f41f493aa14ae'}], 'model': 'DeepSeek